OL,5,G0800 Bargain-Loving Brits in the Sun
OL,6,     FJohn bids farewell to market
OL,7,     Ftrading with help from son Marco.
OL,8,     FWendy & Julia host a Halloween
OL,9,     Ffundraiser for animals, while
OL,10,     Fwedding planner Louise faces a
OL,11,     Fcrisp-filled challenge.
OL,12,G0900 Bargain-Loving Brits in the Sun
OL,13,     FLeonora and Ben's bar hosts a line
OL,14,     Fdancing event while dodging
OL,15,     Ffalling palm tree debris. Jessie
OL,16,     Fconquers her fear of heights, and
OL,17,     FTracey tests her new sausage
OL,18,     Fventure in sunny Spain.
