OL,5,G1000 Nightmare Tenants, Slum Landlords
OL,6,     FDocumentary series. Landlords fall
OL,7,     Ffoul of two young tenants who are
OL,8,     Fusing their rental property as a
OL,9,     Ffilm set. But the tenants have
OL,10,     Fstopped paying the rent and won't
OL,11,     Fleave.
OL,12,G1100 Traffic Cops
OL,13,     FThis episode covers an alarming
OL,14,     Fsurge in burglary and car theft as
OL,15,     Fpolice units pursue a gang of
OL,16,     Fsuspected car thieves using fake
OL,17,     Fregistration plates to steal
OL,18,     Fhigh-powered vehicles.
