OL,5,G2300 Skin A&E
OL,6,     FThe first episode of the new
OL,7,     Fseries features a lipoma so large
OL,8,     Fit may not be safe to tackle under
OL,9,     Flocal anaesthetic, and a woman
OL,10,     Fwho's had alopecia for over 20
OL,11,     Fyears.
OL,12,G0000 999: Killer On The Line
OL,13,     FThe story of how killer Brian Cox
OL,14,     Ffatally attacked father-of-five
OL,15,     FMark Webb before cleaning up the
OL,16,     Fscene and lying about what had
OL,17,     Fhappened.
